flowchart TD
    A[Strictly disable and stop Hi Rokid] --> B[Glasses OFF]
    B --> C[20 s OFF baseline scan]
    C --> D[Automatic scan stop]
    D --> E[Power glasses ON]
    E --> F[30 s transition scan]
    F --> G[Automatic scan stop]
    G --> H[30 s steady-ON scan]
    H --> I[Automatic scan stop]
    I --> J[Exact payload fingerprint groups]
    I --> K[Structure fingerprint groups]
    J --> L[Power-state differential analysis]
    K --> L
    L --> M{Exactly one qualifying cluster\nand score margin >= 20?}
    M -->|Yes| N[Unique BLE identity attributed]
    M -->|No| O[Bounded capture accepted; attribution unresolved]
    N --> P[Resume r25.2 in later deliverable]
    O --> Q[No connection attempted]
